# The listening renders' feed (listening.py): events/scripts/songs.keys with
# each song given about three minutes of test-clock time (idle:60000 is about
# 18 s on this screen), so a whole song fits. The same order, for the same
# reason: the bar's buffer holds MECHBAR, DEATH and LAUNCH; MECH and VICTORY
# overwrite it.
Return Return @snap:hub
Down Down Down Down @snap:bar_sel
Return @snap:bar
song:bar idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 @snap:song_bar
song:death idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 @snap:song_death
song:launch idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 @snap:song_launch
song:mech idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 @snap:song_mech
song:victory idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 idle:60000 @snap:song_victory
